<title>USA: Maxim names new chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Maxim names new chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxim Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday Dale Sander has joined the company as chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>The company has not had a dedicated chief financial officer since it went public in July. Those responsibilities were previously held by President and Chief Executive Officer Larry Stambaugh.</p>
<p>Sander joins Maxim from Xytronyx Inc, where he served as chief financial officer for the past three years.</p>
</text>
